# ── Database (scores + play stats) ──────────────────────────────────
# Without these, data lives in .data/*.json — fine for local dev, but wiped
# on every deploy on serverless hosts. For production:
#   1. Create a free Redis database at https://upstash.com
#      (or via Vercel dashboard → Storage → Upstash for Redis — this injects
#      both vars into the project automatically)
#   2. Copy the REST URL + token from the database page:
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# Visit analytics need no env vars: Vercel Analytics activates automatically
# once the project is deployed on Vercel (enable it in the dashboard).
